# Closeout — canonical issuer carrier integration

Partial completion: the carrier is integrated into offline ROOT08/v2 data validation through the existing owner/codecs. Canonical worker persistence and factual TLS/X509 authority binding remain denied. No CURRENT or private signing was executed.

[Proof and handoff](carrier-proof-and-handoff.md) · [ED11 census](ed11-census.json) · [Tests](test-results.json) · [Exact source patch](exact-source.patch) · [Revocation regression](revocation-test.patch) · [Hashes](final-manifest.json).

Official executor approved the five-file exact patch and the subsequent test-only revocation hunk, each with SHA256 preimage/postimage checks before application. No rejection/bypass occurred. Accepted documents and historical proposals are unchanged; existing format reader behavior and body-only callback are retained.

